# Build output that lands at the repo root when a desktop build is run from
# here instead of apps/desktop. Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: the
# real, tracked apps/desktop/index.html and apps/desktop/main.cjs share these
# names, and an unanchored pattern matches at every depth — which would leave
# them one `git rm --cached` away from being silently untrackable.
/index.html
/main.cjs

# Template masters pulled down by apps/web's showreel encode. The clips it
# writes into public/ are committed; the 1080p sources they come from are not.
apps/web/.showreel-cache/
